  "coverage": {
    "mode": "explicit-classified",
    "gaps": [
      "UCLASS, USTRUCT, UENUM, UINTERFACE, UFUNCTION, UPROPERTY and GENERATED_BODY are bare macro invocations with no terminating semicolon, so they are not C++ expressions and omega-cpp emits no fact for them. Their specifier arguments are unreachable. Reflection is inferred from the .generated.h include instead.",
      "Asset paths written as TEXT(\"/Game/...\") are string-literal call arguments; omega-cpp captures no call argument, so which asset a LoadObject resolves to is not answerable.",
      "A call in a .cpp file lies inside no span omega-cpp emits for its enclosing class or member function, so an engine-API use is keyed to its own site rather than to the type that performs it."
    ]
